WEBVTT

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.080
Yamasaki-san, you're up next!

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:38.830
Kiyori-chan, how many have you had today?

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.940
Look, look!

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.520
Isn't she cute?!

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.510
See, isn't she cute?!

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:56.860
Well, I guess...

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:59.960
Oh, she's the reader model for that magazine.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:02.700
She's just too cute!

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.100
I want to be friends with her!

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.910
Oh! Time to get her number
from the editorial department!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.610
Hold it right there!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.440
Then, how about her address?

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.120
No!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.070
Her postal code?

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.650
What would you do with that?!

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:27.600
Tsk, you're no fun.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:31.660
"Tsk"?

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:38.370
That's my line.

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:01.370
Um, President?

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.240
We need to take the roll.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:12.960
Well, it can't be helped.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.990
You do it, Vice President.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:16.480
Okay...

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.260
What do you mean,
"It can't be helped"?

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:33.160
She dunked?!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:36.670
A dunk shot in a P.E. class?!

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:39.170
Watch out, Akemiya!

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:46.310
Amazing — she's number one?

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:52.970
I stayed up all night studying,
and ended up sleeping right through the test.

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:54.140
No wonder you failed.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.240
That's incredible, Sumi-chan!

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.430
It's normal.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:01.690
I heard that Murasame's house is a karate dojo,

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.580
and she's supposedly a black belt.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:06.770
Rumor has it that she took down five high schoolers when she was in middle school,

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:10.660
and became known as "Raging Blade Murasame."

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.730
Wasn't it "Mythical Blade"?

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:16.280
No, it's "Raging Blade" — a katana that takes your life.

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:20.890
That's so not cute.

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.400
Oh my.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:32.480
Sumi-chan.

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:34.550
Sumi-chan!

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:52.030
You shouldn't scare our classmates like that.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:53.730
Sorry.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:58.020
You intimidate people since you're so tall.

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:00.420
My bad...

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:04.540
This might look good.

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.660
Oh, that looks nice...

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.180
Yep, it looks good.

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:24.940
Well?

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:27.440
It doesn't suit me.

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:29.540
Besides, it's expensive.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.450
I think it looks fine, though.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:38.600
Sumi-chan, you really have no interest in these things.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:22.420
Kazama?

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:23.880
Look, Sumi-chan!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:26.880
Doesn't she look a little like that other model?

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:29.040
She's in elementary school!

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:31.030
So cute!

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:42.200
Kazama, you're only really interested
in cute little girls, aren't you?

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.350
What do you mean?

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.300
Cute girls are cute, aren't they?

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:47.340
What?

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:53.910
They're cute, small, and they
look good in fluffy, frilly clothes.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:57.410
Doesn't it somehow make you
happy just looking at them?

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:27.200
"Sumi-chan, you really have no interest in these things."

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.370
Are you going somewhere?

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:32.210
The bookstore.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:33.790
Dinner is almost ready.

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:35.270
I'll be back soon.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.290
Oh, this is so cute!

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:52.790
Oh, this was on sale at Dogenyama earlier.

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:02.400
Let's go.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.210
What was she?

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.020
Insane...

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:16.830
How can you wear something this flamboyant?

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.720
"Loli Elle is coming this year."

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:22.320
Where?

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:34.580
I guess girls only really look cute in something like this.

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:43.010
Oh, but this might actually be good.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.070
No!

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:55.500
A-Ah, I'm terribly sorry!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:06.660
Miss, please don't throw the books.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:11.130
So cute...

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.190
If Kazama saw her, she'd cause a ruckus.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.760
Thank you.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:32.070
She's also short.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:39.030
Murasame-san! Could you help me with this?

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.000
Could you help me too?

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:50.790
She's something of a klutz...

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:54.620
...and I somehow end up wanting to protect her.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.500
Just like that...

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.180
You're so cool, Sumi-chan!

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:12.550
Man, Murasame's incredible.

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:15.690
She's too perfect to be cute, though—

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:31.350
I wish I'd been born a little cuter.

00:11:32.360 --> 00:11:34.080
If I had...

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:37.860
...I'm certain Kazama would've looked at me...

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.770
Huh? Ushio-chan, where's Murasame-san?

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:55.520
She has a meeting with the Class Committee today.

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:57.930
I asked her if I should wait for her, but...

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:06.880
Kiyori-chan, didn't Sumi-chan seem a little weird today?

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:11.120
Eh? I think she was more or less her usual self.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:18.810
That reminds me — our upperclassmen
bought that magazine.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:22.960
That girl — Ushio-chan's favorite.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.050
So, who's next?

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.350
First year, class two.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:33.030
Now that I take a closer look,
she really looks like the girl from yesterday.

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:36.410
I apologize for being late.

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:39.270
Everyone accounted for.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:43.710
All right, we'll begin the meeting now, everyone.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.390
Well, of course she'd be cute.

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:03.350
I think... you're cute, Murasame-san.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:10.470
Well, then—

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.560
Huh?!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:32.880
What did you say?

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:35.460
Um, the meeting...

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.090
Not that!

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:43.060
You... said it, right?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:48.170
That I'm... cute...

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:51.740
Yeah.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.140
Are you mocking me, Akemiya-kun?!

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:03.580
Cute? Me?

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:06.490
I'm so much taller than you!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:10.970
In a fight, I'd injure — no, I'd destroy you!

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:17.220
You're cute, Murasame-san. You're cute.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.970
Um, Murasame-san?

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:39.230
Kazama... I'm cute!

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:42.270
Cute!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.640
So, you were also on your way to the convenience store, Sumi-chan?

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:17.180
Yes, that's right — the convenience store!

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:22.770
Isn't that the outfit from yesterday?

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:24.490
So you bought it!

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:28.780
Yeah, since you picked it out for me.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.420
Yes, it suits you!

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:32.280
Very cute!

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:37.860
That's a relief.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:42.900
I was worried, since something seemed to be troubling you earlier today.

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:44.790
I guess it was just my imagination.

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:58.890
Kazama... Ah, wait a second!

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:02.800
They carry a poor selection!

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.140
Let's go somewhere else.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:05.640
Eh?

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:09.750
You were too quick in finishing your errand.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:11.280
The timing is...

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:14.160
Oh, well.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:20.540
With Sumi-chan by my side,
the dark streets don't seem so scary.

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:29.350
We've done this before, haven't we?

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:35.800
Back in middle school, at the park, when those three boys kept harassing us.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:39.810
You were right beside me and fended them off.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.810
You were incredible!

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:49.070
You have such noble features, and you're tall.

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:54.690
Kazama...

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:04.150
You would've been idolized at an all-girls school.

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:07.430
Everyone would be calling you "Onee-sama."

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.530
You're not my type, though.

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:22.060
Sumi-chan?

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:26.720
I'm going home.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:30.600
But the convenience store...

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.520
It's fine.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:34.650
Then, wait a little while.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:35.780
I'm scared!

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.400
What's wrong with her?

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:00.800
Sumi-chan! That girl!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.420
She's that reader model!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.210
Wait!

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.050
Hey!

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.160
Hey! Seriously!

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:33.860
Wait!

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:36.570
That girl — she's not really weird!

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:43.080
Well, maybe a little weird,
but she really just likes cute girls!

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:48.270
She always finds herself in
these unrequited relationships!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:52.840
If only there was something I could do for her, I would!

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:56.300
But I can't!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.260
Because she told me that I won't do!

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:04.440
I know that, and yet...

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:26.630
Akemiya-kun?

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:40.150
I think I fell for you at first sight, Murasame-san. Back in middle school.

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:47.720
But as I watched you, I...

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:51.360
Well, you liked Kazama-san...

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:58.340
So, let me get this straight — you started cross-dressing to pique my interest?

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.110
Well, yeah.

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.720
Then, my little sister found out.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:09.500
As a joke, she mailed a picture to that magazine, and it was accepted.

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:16.010
It's true! This is really embarrassing.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:20.320
I thought I'd at least confiscate the
magazines around the neighborhood,

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:24.520
but buying them as a man — it'd be so shameful!

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:28.330
Well, it'd be infinitely more shameful to be exposed while dressed like that.

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:40.990
Um...

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.840
Am I not good enough for you?

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.230
Nope.

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:54.480
If I told you that, would you be able to give up?

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:59.860
See? I couldn't either.

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:06.080
Whether or not I'm good enough for her, I still like her.

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:14.250
Really, this unrequited love...

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:20.830
Hey, wait a second!

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:24.090
I lost to a boy? At being cute?!

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:30.110
I think you're cute though, Murasame-san!

00:21:30.110 --> 00:21:31.640
Spare me your pity!

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:39.390
That's not fair, Sumi-chan!
You became friends with her before me!

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:13.900
Where's my brother?

00:23:14.510 --> 00:23:16.530
He just came home.

00:23:17.230 --> 00:23:21.040
Manaka, don't tease him too much.

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:22.320
Okay...

00:23:26.540 --> 00:23:28.030
Thank goodness...

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:33.770
Murasame-san didn't say that I was gross...

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:37.120
Next time: First Kiss

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:38.360
Bone!

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:40.670
What, so it's still not Kazama?

00:23:40.670 --> 00:23:41.690
Bone!

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:43.230
Eh? The preview needs more impact?

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:45.680
That's just weird;
the next episode is supposed to be touching!

00:23:45.680 --> 00:23:46.890
Bone...

00:23:46.890 --> 00:23:48.820
Oh, I see; you have no spine.

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:50.970
Wait — I just wasted two puns in a row, didn't I?
